        "reference": "Judges 20:2",
        "book": "Judges",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "(Now the children of Benjamin heard that the children of Israel were gone up to Mizpeh.) Then said the children of Israel, Tell us, how was this wickedness?",
