        "book": "Judges",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 33
      },
      {
        "text": "And there came against Gibeah ten thousand chosen men out of all Israel, and the battle was sore: but they knew not that evil was near them.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 92,
            "end": 96,
